<div class="im-single im-wrap-wide" data-sidebar="on" style="--im-single-aside: 20rem">
	<article class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
		<header class="im-abouthero">
			<img class="im-abouthero-face" src="{{demo.author.profile_image}}" alt="" loading="eager">
			<div class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: .75rem">
				<p class="im-eyebrow">About</p>
				<h1 class="im-collhead-title">I build things for the web and write down what they cost.</h1>
				<p class="im-lede" style="margin: 0">Eight years of Salesforce consulting, four of them freelance, and a design system I am selling because I got tired of paying for ones I could not modify. Currently in Amsterdam.</p>
				<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem">
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-primary im-btn-sm" href="/pages/contact/">{{icon "mail"}}Get in touch</a>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="/pages/now/">{{icon "zap"}}What I am doing now</a>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="#">{{icon "download"}}CV</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="im-expstats">
			<span><strong>8</strong>Years</span>
			<span><strong>{{demo.projects.length}}</strong>Projects</span>
			<span><strong>34</strong>Posts this year</span>
			<span><strong>4,210</strong>Readers</span>
			<span><strong>6</strong>Countries</span>
		</div>

		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-content-lede">
			<p>I started writing this site because I kept answering the same questions in Slack and wanted somewhere to point. It turned into the thing I am best known for, which was not the plan and has been better than the plan.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="im-content im-content-flush">
			<h2>What I actually do</h2>
			<p>Three things, in the order I spend time on them. <strong>Salesforce consulting</strong> — eight years, mostly public sector, mostly the projects that are already late when I arrive. <strong>Design systems and Ghost themes</strong> — this one, and the theme this site runs on, both of which are for sale. <strong>Writing</strong> — a post a fortnight and a letter to go with it.</p>

			<h2>How I work</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Two days a week, six weeks at a time.</strong> Anything longer and I become staff, which is not what either of us is paying for.</li>
				<li><strong>Written down, always.</strong> Every engagement ends with a document somebody who was not there can act on.</li>
				<li><strong>I will tell you not to do it.</strong> Roughly a third of the conversations I have end with "you do not need me for this", and those are the ones that turn into the next referral.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Before this</h2>
			<p>A degree I do not use, four years inside a consultancy learning what not to do, and one startup that did not survive contact with its own market. The <a href="/collections/timeline/">timeline</a> has the rest of it in order.</p>

			<h2>The site itself</h2>
			<p>Ghost, on a theme I wrote, on a design system I wrote. No third-party scripts, no tracking, no cookie banner because there is nothing to consent to. The <a href="/provenance/">colophon</a> lists every dependency and its licence.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="work">Selected work</h2>
			<div class="im-repos" style="--im-repos-min: 18rem">
				{{#each demo.projects}}{{#match @index "<" 3}}{{> "components/repo-card" cta=true}}{{/match}}{{/each}}
			</div>
		</section>
	</article>

